      "body": "yeah I'm not convinced we need a tracking issue for this either.\n\nUsually they are for tracking a (much) larger or longer-running project. Linking 3 refactor PRs in an issue as a sort of todo list doesn't really fit that. That said, there are arguably one or two other similar \"projects\" in the [tracking label](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues?q=is%3Aissue%20state%3Aopen%20tracking%20label%3A%22Tracking%20Issue%22), so perhaps it's ok if other want it open...",
